{"id": "2775e81a-b1e9-4366-aaa4-8aa70d2d775e", "slug": "connect-your-ecosystem", "title": "Connect Your Ecosystem", "description": "Connect Ecosystem Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Connect Your Ecosystem\"\ndescription: \"Connect Ecosystem Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#34D399\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#2563EB\"\n  background: \"#000000\"\n  surface: \"#CBD5E1\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#CBD5E1\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Caveat\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Connect Your Ecosystem\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 420; favorites: 14; remixes: 2.\nTags: feature, section, animated, cta, bento.\n## Overview\nConnect Ecosystem Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nSeamless Integrations Connect your ecosystem. Without friction. Unify your tools, teams, and data in one beautiful interface. Experience a seamlessly integrated workflow designed for modern scale. +2,450 teams connected…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Connect your ecosystem. Without friction.; Real-time sync; Enterprise secure; Unified insights; Built for teams.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #34D399, secondary #000000, accent #2563EB, background #000000, surface #CBD5E1, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Caveat for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Connect Your Ecosystem</title>\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Google Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Caveat:wght@500&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400;1,500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP & ScrollTrigger -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                        serif: ['Playfair Display', 'serif'],\n                        hand: ['Caveat', 'cursive'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        brand: {\n                            50: '#eff6ff',\n                            100: '#dbeafe',\n                            400: '#60a5fa',\n                            500: '#3b82f6',\n                            600: '#2563eb',\n                            700: '#1d4ed8',\n                            900: '#1e3a8a',\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-[#fcfdfd] to-[#edf1f5] text-slate-900 font-sans antialiased overflow-x-hidden min-h-screen relative selection:bg-blue-200 selection:text-blue-900\">\n\n    <!-- Background Ambient Glows -->\n    <div class=\"fixed top-[-20%] left-[-10%] w-[50vw] h-[50vw] rounded-full bg-blue-100/40 blur-[120px] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed bottom-[-10%] right-[-10%] w-[40vw] h-[40vw] rounded-full bg-indigo-50/50 blur-[100px] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n    <main class=\"relative w-full max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12 pt-24 sm:pt-32 pb-24\">\n\n        <!-- Hero Section -->\n        <div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 lg:gap-8 items-center hero-container relative z-10\">\n\n            <!-- LEFT SIDE: Content -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-start max-w-xl hero-content\">\n\n                <!-- Badge -->\n                <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-md px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-blue-600 shadow-[0_2px_10px_-4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] border border-white/50 mb-8 transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform cursor-default\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:link-circle-linear\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                    Seamless Integrations\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Headline (GSAP Staggered Reveal) -->\n                <h1 class=\"text-[3.5rem] leading-[1.1] sm:text-6xl sm:leading-[1.1] tracking-tight mb-6\">\n                    <div class=\"overflow-hidden pb-1\"><div class=\"reveal-text font-serif text-slate-900\">Connect your</div></div>\n                    <div class=\"overflow-hidden pb-1\"><div class=\"reveal-text font-serif text-slate-900\">ecosystem.</div></div>\n                    <div class=\"overflow-hidden pb-2 pt-1\"><div class=\"reveal-text font-serif italic text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 drop-shadow-sm font-medium\">Without friction.</div></div>\n                </h1>\n\n                <!-- Line Separator -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 mb-6\">\n                    <div class=\"h-[2px] w-8 rounded-full bg-blue-600\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"h-[2px] w-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Paragraph -->\n                <p class=\"text-lg text-slate-500 mb-10 max-w-[420px] leading-relaxed\">\n                    Unify your tools, teams, and data in one beautiful interface. Experience a seamlessly integrated workflow designed for modern scale.\n                </p>\n\n                <!-- Avatars & Stats -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-10\">\n                    <div class=\"flex -space-x-3\">\n                        <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/4f5668c5-fc4a-44e0-bc5e-a664189d3c31_800w.jpg\" alt=\"User\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-[#f8fafd] object-cover shadow-sm\">\n                        <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/eca707cc-a5b7-439a-b4fd-247f6106c2e1_800w.jpg\" alt=\"User\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-[#f8fafd] object-cover shadow-sm\">\n                        <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/c92852bb-a510-405a-85ab-ffa0fde136a4_800w.jpg\" alt=\"User\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-[#f8fafd] object-cover shadow-sm\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-blue-50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 border border-blue-100\">+2,450</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-500\">teams connected</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- CTA & Annotation Container -->\n                <div class=\"relative flex items-center gap-6\">\n                    <!-- Premium CTA Button -->\n                    <button class=\"cta-button group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-700 via-blue-600 to-indigo-700 px-8 py-3.5 text-base font-medium text-white shadow-[0_8px_30px_-6px_rgba(37,99,235,0.6)] transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-[0_12px_40px_-8px_rgba(79,70,229,0.8)] overflow-hidden\">\n                        <!-- Inner glass reflection -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/20 to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                        <!-- Glow bloom -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute -inset-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 to-indigo-400 opacity-0 blur-xl transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-40 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                        <span class=\"relative z-10\">Explore Integrations</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"relative z-10 text-xl transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n\n                    <!-- Handwritten Annotation -->\n                    <div class=\"hidden sm:flex items-center text-blue-400 opacity-80\" style=\"transform: rotate(-2deg);\">\n                        <svg width=\"60\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 24\" fill=\"none\" class=\"mr-2 mt-2\">\n                            <path d=\"M59 12C45 12 25 18 2 20M2 20L8 14M2 20L10 23\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                        <span class=\"font-hand text-xl tracking-wide\">200+ integrations</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- RIGHT SIDE: Futuristic Globe & Ecosystem -->\n            <div class=\"relative w-full aspect-square max-w-[650px] mx-auto lg:ml-auto right-globe-container mt-12 lg:mt-0\" style=\"perspective: 1200px;\">\n\n                <!-- Main Volumetric Background Glow -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-10 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-300/30 via-indigo-200/20 to-transparent blur-[80px] pointer-events-none mix-blend-multiply\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Abstract Holographic Data Sphere -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-[15%] pointer-events-none\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(circle, #94a3b8 1.5px, transparent 1.5px); background-size: 8px 8px; border-radius: 50%; mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, black 40%, transparent 65%); -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, black 40%, transparent 65%); transform: rotateX(15deg) rotateY(-15deg); opacity: 0.6;\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Secondary Sphere Layer for depth -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-[17%] pointer-events-none globe-rotate\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(circle, #cbd5e1 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 12px 12px; border-radius: 50%; mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, black 30%, transparent 60%); -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, black 30%, transparent 60%);\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Center Core -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-[36%] z-20 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-400 to-indigo-600 shadow-[0_0_80px_rgba(79,70,229,0.5),inset_0_4px_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.4)] flex items-center justify-center border border-white/20 backdrop-blur-xl\">\n                    <div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-white shadow-inner rounded-full flex items-center justify-center pulse-core\">\n                        <!-- Custom Abstract Logo inside core -->\n                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-1 rotate-45\">\n                            <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Orbital Rings (Simulated 3D) -->\n                <!-- Ring 1 -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-[-5%] rounded-full border-[1.5px] border-blue-200/40 orbital-path\" style=\"transform: rotateX(65deg) rotateY(-15deg);\"></div>\n                <!-- Ring 2 -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-[5%] rounded-full border-[1.5px] border-indigo-200/30 orbital-path-reverse\" style=\"transform: rotateX(75deg) rotateY(20deg);\"></div>\n                <!-- Ring 3 -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-[15%] rounded-full border-[1px] border-slate-300/40 orbital-path\" style=\"transform: rotateX(60deg) rotateY(5deg);\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Connecting Lines (SVG overlay for precise drawing) -->\n                <svg class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-10\" viewBox=\"0 0 650 650\" fill=\"none\">\n                    <path d=\"M325 325 L210 180\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\" class=\"opacity-60\"/>\n                    <path d=\"M325 325 L480 150\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\" class=\"opacity-60\"/>\n                    <path d=\"M325 325 L450 480\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\" class=\"opacity-60\"/>\n                    <path d=\"M325 325 L180 400\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\" class=\"opacity-60\"/>\n                </svg>\n\n                <!-- Floating Integration Cards -->\n\n                <!-- GitHub (Top Left) -->\n                <div class=\"float-card absolute top-[15%] left-[20%] z-30 group cursor-pointer\" style=\"transform-origin: center;\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md rounded-[1.25rem] shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.06)] border border-slate-100 p-3.5 pr-5 flex flex-col gap-2 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:shadow-[0_12px_40px_rgb(0,0,0,0.1)] group-hover:bg-white relative\">\n                        <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center absolute -top-4 -left-3 shadow-sm\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"mdi:github\" class=\"text-[1.3rem] text-slate-800\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"pl-4\">\n                            <div class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-slate-800 leading-none mb-1\">GitHub</div>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[10px] font-medium text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider\">\n                                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(52,211,153,0.8)]\"></div> Connected\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Slack (Top Right) -->\n                <div class=\"float-card absolute top-[8%] right-[15%] z-30 group cursor-pointer\" style=\"animation-delay: -1s;\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md rounded-[1.25rem] shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.06)] border border-slate-100 p-3.5 pr-5 flex flex-col gap-2 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:shadow-[0_12px_40px_rgb(0,0,0,0.1)] group-hover:bg-white relative\">\n                        <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center absolute -top-6 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 shadow-sm\">\n                            <!-- Simple Slack logo approximation -->\n                            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-0.5 scale-[0.6]\">\n                                <div class=\"w-3 h-3 bg-red-400 rounded-tl-full rounded-bl-full rounded-br-full\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-3 h-3 bg-blue-400 rounded-tr-full rounded-tl-full rounded-br-full\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-3 h-3 bg-yellow-400 rounded-tl-full rounded-bl-full rounded-br-full\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-3 h-3 bg-green-400 rounded-tr-full rounded-bl-full rounded-br-full\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n                            <div class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-slate-800 leading-none mb-1\">Slack</div>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 text-[10px] font-medium text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider\">\n                                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(52,211,153,0.8)]\"></div> Connected\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- AWS (Bottom Left) -->\n                <div class=\"float-card absolute bottom-[25%] left-[5%] z-30 group cursor-pointer\" style=\"animation-delay: -2s;\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md rounded-[1.25rem] shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.06)] border border-slate-100 p-3.5 pr-5 flex flex-col gap-2 transition-all durat